<title>USA: Traverse, Mich.,  won by Roney &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Traverse, Mich.,  won by Roney &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roney &amp; Co. said it won $8.340 million of Traverse Area Dist. Library, Mich., general obligation 1996 library building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.34 percent.</p>
</text>
